# Learn Chinese — core

## Stack

Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, TypeScript strict, Tailwind 4, Prisma 7 (PostgreSQL + MongoDB auth).

## Layout

- `src/app/` — pages and API routes (no `/chinese` prefix)
- `src/services/chinese/` — business logic (prefer adding logic here, not in route handlers)
- `src/lib/` — shared utils, hooks, tests under `src/lib/__tests__/`
- `src/lib/harness/` — offline evaluation harness (Hanzi golden cases)
- `@/` alias → `src/`

## Before finishing a change

```bash
npm run quality    # or at minimum: npm test && npm run lint
```

Hanzi AI / trust policy changes also run:

```bash
npm run harness:hanzi
```

## General rules

- Minimize diff scope; match existing naming and patterns in the file you edit
- Only mock Prisma in service tests, not pure logic tests
- Read `AGENTS.md` for domain entry points — do not scan the whole repo
- Live DeepSeek scripts (`npm run hanzi:batch`) are manual only — never wire into CI or `npm test`
